OL,3,GNEWSATaxi driver given fake cash drove
OL,4,Acustomer to police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was arrested after a taxi driver
OL,7,Fwho was given fake cash drove the
OL,8,Fsuspect straight to a police station.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the driver
OL,11,Fpicked up the suspect from Nottingham
OL,12,FRoad at 23:30 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FWhen the customer continued to change
OL,15,Fhis route, the taxi driver asked how he
OL,16,Fwould be paying, which is when he was
OL,17,Fhanded a counterfeit #20 note, the
OL,18,Fforce added.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
